| heading1 = 1911 [[Consumption Act]] 
| content1 = Regulates labeling of products containing certain drugs including {{W|cocaine}} and {{W|heroin}}

| heading2 = 1914 [[Industrial Hemp Production Act]]
| content2 = Liberalized laws for the industrial production of {{W|hemp}} and hemp-derived products

| heading3 = 1959 [[Marijuana for Medicinal Purposes Regulations]]
| content3 = Legalized {{W|cannabis (drug)|cannabis}} and several other drugs for medical and {{W|Religion and drugs|religious use}}

| heading4 = 1961 {{W|Single Convention on Narcotic Drugs|Convention on Narcotics}}
| content4 = Treaty to control marijuana

| heading5 = 1962 [[Cannabis Initiative]]
| content5 = Fully legalized consumption, sale and transportation of {{W|Cannabis (drug)|Cannabis}}

| heading6 = 1996 [[Decriminalization Act]]
| content6 = Decriminalized {{W|recreational drug use|recreational use}} of {{W|cocaine}}, {{W|heroin}}, {{W|magic mushrooms}} and other {{W|psychoactive drugs}}

| heading7 = 2021 [[Responsible Consumption Initiative]]
| content7 = Fully legalized all drug consumption <br> and withdrew from {{W|Single Convention of Narcotic Drugs|Convention on Narcotics}}

